     "value": "Baserow (<a href=\"https://baserow.io\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://baserow.io</a>) | Product Specialist | REMOTE (Europe) | Full-time | German-speaking<p>We're building an open-source no-code platform for databases, applications, and automations.<p>We're looking for a technical, customer-facing Product Specialist to help customers build solutions with Baserow. Ideal experience includes Airtable, n8n, APIs, databases, and automation. Fluent German and English required.<p>Remote-first, flexible hours, competitive salary + stock options.<p>Details &amp; apply: <a href=\"https://baserow.io/jobs/product-specialist-baserow\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://baserow.io/jobs/product-specialist-baserow</a>"
