    "comment_text": {
     "matchLevel": "none",
     "matchedWords": [],
     "value": "Irash Tech | Business Development Manager (Freelance, Commission-only) | REMOTE (Worldwide) | Contract<p>Irash Tech is a small AI-focused development agency based in Hyderabad, India. We build web apps (Next.js, React, Node), mobile apps (React Native/Expo) and AI automation (LLM integrations, RAG, document processing, n8n/Python workflows) for startups and small businesses.<p>I'm the founder, an engineer with 7+ years in full-stack and AI, and I handle scoping and delivery. I'm looking for people anywhere in the world who can find and close clients in their own market.<p>- 15% of project value on every client you close, paid within 14 days of client payment\n- 12 months of commission on repeat work from clients you bring\n- Commission-only, no base salary. Non-exclusive, so it works alongside your other work\n- You own the client relationship and negotiation; final quotes are approved by us<p>Good fit: you know founders, SMBs or agencies that need software built, and you've sold software, dev or digital services before.<p>Apply: <a href=\"https://www.irashtech.com/careers/business-development-manager\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.irashtech.com/careers/business-development-manag...</a>\nOr email [email] with a short note on one deal you've closed."
    },
