   "comment_text": "Irash Tech | Business Development Manager (Freelance, Commission-only) | REMOTE (Worldwide) | Contract<p>Irash Tech is a small AI-focused development agency based in Hyderabad, India. We build web apps (Next.js, React, Node), mobile apps (React Native&#x2F;Expo) and AI automation (LLM integrations, RAG, document processing, n8n&#x2F;Python workflows) for startups and small businesses.<p>I&#x27;m the founder, an engineer with 7+ years in full-stack and AI, and I handle scoping and delivery. I&#x27;m looking for people anywhere in the world who can find and close clients in their own market.<p>- 15% of project value on every client you close, paid within 14 days of client payment\n- 12 months of commission on repeat work from clients you bring\n- Commission-only, no base salary. Non-exclusive, so it works alongside your other work\n- You own the client relationship and negotiation; final quotes are approved by us<p>Good fit: you know founders, SMBs or agencies that need software built, and you&#x27;ve sold software, dev or digital services before.<p>Apply: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.irashtech.com&#x2F;careers&#x2F;business-development-manager\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.irashtech.com&#x2F;careers&#x2F;business-development-manag...</a>\nOr email [email] with a short note on one deal you&#x27;ve closed.",
