     "value": "Matcha.fm | REMOTE (Worldwide: US / Canada / Europe / UK / LATAM) | Full-time | <a href=\"https://matcha.fm\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://matcha.fm</a><p>I'm a Canadian repeat founder working on agents that cut the noise in large dataset search.<p>Looking for a great builder (founding software engineer) and a great marketer both with a track record of virality and driving product distribution.<p>Fully remote anywhere in the world, with some US / EU timezone overlap.<p>The same salary regardless of where you live<p>No micromanagement, no unnecessary calls<p>Calm, low-distraction culture to do your best work<p>Founding Software Engineer : <a href=\"https://matcha.fm/apply/fse\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://matcha.fm/apply/fse</a><p>Founding Marketer : <a href=\"https://matcha.fm/apply/marketing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://matcha.fm/apply/marketing</a>"
