   "comment_text": "Matcha.fm | REMOTE (Worldwide: US &#x2F; Canada &#x2F; Europe &#x2F; UK &#x2F; LATAM) | Full-time | <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;matcha.fm\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;matcha.fm</a><p>I&#x27;m a Canadian repeat founder working on agents that cut the noise in large dataset search.<p>Looking for a great builder (founding software engineer) and a great marketer both with a track record of virality and driving product distribution.<p>Fully remote anywhere in the world, with some US &#x2F; EU timezone overlap.<p>The same salary regardless of where you live<p>No micromanagement, no unnecessary calls<p>Calm, low-distraction culture to do your best work<p>Founding Software Engineer : <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;matcha.fm&#x2F;apply&#x2F;fse\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;matcha.fm&#x2F;apply&#x2F;fse</a><p>Founding Marketer : <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;matcha.fm&#x2F;apply&#x2F;marketing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;matcha.fm&#x2F;apply&#x2F;marketing</a>",
