     "value": "Willow Education | Product Manager (design-led) | REMOTE (US) | Full-time | $80k–$130k + equity | <a href=\"https://willowed.org/careers/product-manager\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://willowed.org/careers/product-manager</a><p>We build a career and postsecondary readiness platform for schools and community organizations. Five-person team, public benefit corporation. You'd own problems from user research through shipped product, do the design work yourself, and use AI daily, including building coded prototypes. Time in or around American public schools is a big plus.<p>Priority deadline: Sunday, Oct 18. Questions: [email]"
